  "b0bzcmdzns": {"title":"U Shaped Memory Foam Neck Pillow With Adjustable Snap Closure Soft Velvet Removable Cover Travel Pillow For Airplane Car Train Office Napping With Compact Carry Bag (Grey)","bullets":"Ergonomic Memory Foam Support: The contoured U-shape gently cradles your neck and head to help maintain natural alignment and reduce fatigue during long flights, road trips, train rides, or office breaks.\n\nAdjustable Snap Closure: A sturdy buckle with multiple snap settings lets you secure the pillow loosely or snugly around your neck, giving you personalized comfort and stable support while sleeping upright.\n\nSoft Velvet Removable Cover: The plush, breathable velvet cover feels smooth against skin and unzips easily for quick removal and machine washing, keeping your pillow fresh trip after trip.\n\nCompact Travel Design: The pillow rolls up neatly into the included drawstring carry bag, saving valuable luggage space and protecting the pillow from dust when stored at home or on the go.\n\nVersatile Everyday Comfort: Ideal for airplanes, cars, buses, trains, camping, and desk naps, this pillow offers reliable neck support for adults and teens during commutes, vacations, and relaxing afternoons.","sku":"US-Z03AX2","images":["/images/products/B0BZCMDZNS/1.webp","/images/products/B0BZCMDZNS/2.webp","/images/products/B0BZCMDZNS/3.webp","/images/products/B0BZCMDZNS/4.webp","/images/products/B0BZCMDZNS/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,true,false,false,false]},
  "b0bzcln57s": {"title":"Makimoo Memory Foam Travel Neck Pillow U Shaped With Adjustable Snap Closure Portable Drawstring Bag Breathable Soft Cover For Airplane Car Train Bus Home Office Naps (Black)","bullets":"360-Degree Ergonomic Neck Support: The U-shaped design wraps gently around your neck and chin to help keep your head upright and aligned while sitting. It helps reduce neck strain during long flights, road trips, train rides, or bus commutes.\n\nPremium Memory Foam Filling: Made with responsive memory foam combined with microbeads, this pillow molds to the natural curve of your neck and returns to shape within 5 seconds. The balanced softness and support help relieve pressure points for more relaxed rest.\n\nBreathable and Sweat-Resistant Cover: The soft velvet-like cover allows airflow to help keep you cool and comfortable during extended use. It feels gentle against skin and resists sweat buildup, making it suitable for warm cabins or long journeys.\n\nAdjustable Snap Closure with Travel Bag: A side snap button lets you secure the pillow comfortably under your chin or attach it to a bag when not in use. The included lightweight drawstring bag makes packing and carrying easy for travel.\n\nLightweight and Versatile for Anywhere: Use it on airplanes, in cars, on trains or buses, or while relaxing at home or in the office. Its compact, portable design makes it a practical companion for commuting, napping, reading, or watching TV.","sku":"US-CQ168O","images":["/images/products/B0BZCLN57S/1.webp","/images/products/B0BZCLN57S/2.webp","/images/products/B0BZCLN57S/3.webp","/images/products/B0BZCLN57S/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,false,false,true]},
  "b0bxckknn8": {"title":"Makimoo Travel Neck Pillow Memory Foam U-Shaped Support with Hump Design Adjustable Strap Soft Breathable Removable Cover Machine Washable for Airplane Car Office Rest (Black)","bullets":"Ergonomic Hump Design for Comfortable Support: The contoured U-shaped memory foam gently cradles your head, neck, and chin to help maintain natural alignment while you rest during flights, road trips, or train rides.\n\nPremium Slow-Rebound Memory Foam Core: High-density memory foam adapts to your unique shape and provides balanced cushioning that relieves pressure points, then slowly returns to its original form after each use.\n\nSoft, Breathable and Machine-Washable Cover: The skin-friendly outer fabric features breathable mesh panels to keep air flowing, while the zippered cover removes easily for convenient cleaning between trips.\n\nAdjustable Toggle Closure for a Secure Fit: The front cord lock lets you tighten or loosen the pillow around your neck, so it stays comfortably in place whether you are sitting upright in a plane or reclining in a car.\n\nTravel-Ready with a Compact Carry Bag: Lightweight and compressible, this neck pillow includes a drawstring storage bag that keeps it clean and easy to pack in your carry-on, backpack, or luggage.","sku":"US-Y6J0CA","images":["/images/products/B0BXCKKNN8/1.webp","/images/products/B0BXCKKNN8/2.webp","/images/products/B0BXCKKNN8/3.webp","/images/products/B0BXCKKNN8/4.webp","/images/products/B0BXCKKNN8/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,false,false,false,false]},
  "b0bcjqyyl1": {"title":"Outdoor Chair Cushions Set of 2 Thick Patio Seat and Back Cushions with Ties Water Resistant Garden Lounge Chair Pads Birds and Flowers Pattern for Indoor Outdoor Use 110 x 55 cm (Khaki)","bullets":"Set of 2 Matching Cushions: Each all-weather chair cushion measures 110 x 55cm, giving you a coordinated pair for refreshing patio, garden, or balcony seating.\n\nWater-Resistant Polyester Cover: Woven from durable 100% polyester, the fabric helps shed light moisture and withstands everyday outdoor use while remaining soft to the touch.\n\nSecure Corner Ties: Integrated ties attach the cushion to your chair frame to keep it from sliding, so you can sit back and relax without constant readjusting.\n\nPlush Seat-and-Back Support: The cushioned fill provides a comfortable layer for both the seat and back, making long afternoons outdoors more enjoyable.\n\nFloral Bird Print in Khaki: The classic khaki base with a colorful birds-and-flowers pattern complements wood, metal, and wicker furniture for a fresh patio update.","sku":"US-IK9X28","images":["/images/products/B0BCJQYYL1/1.webp","/images/products/B0BCJQYYL1/2.webp","/images/products/B0BCJQYYL1/3.webp","/images/products/B0BCJQYYL1/4.webp","/images/products/B0BCJQYYL1/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,true,false,false,false]},
