  "b0c39zsd3q": {"title":"Makimoo Outdoor Chair Cushions Set of 2 Thick Patio Furniture Seat and Back Cushions with Ties 110 x 55 cm Floral Paisley Pattern for Garden Lounge Chairs (Khaki Floral)","bullets":"Complete 2-Piece Set: Each order includes two matching chair cushions, generously sized at 110 x 55cm to fit a wide range of patio, garden, and dining chairs with combined seat and back support.\n\nDurable Fabric Construction: Made with a sturdy woven fabric that holds up well to regular outdoor and indoor use, offering a reliable seating upgrade for patios, decks, balconies, and sunrooms.\n\nPlush Supportive Padding: Filled with resilient fiber cushioning that provides soft yet supportive comfort for your seat and back, making long afternoons outdoors more relaxing.\n\nSecure Corner Ties: Attached ties at the corners help keep each cushion firmly in place, reducing slipping and shifting while you sit, stand, or move around.\n\nVibrant Floral Paisley Pattern: The elegant khaki base features a bold botanical paisley print in red, blue, and green tones, adding a lively decorative accent to your outdoor living space.","sku":"US-26H899","images":["/images/products/B0C39ZSD3Q/1.webp","/images/products/B0C39ZSD3Q/2.webp","/images/products/B0C39ZSD3Q/3.webp","/images/products/B0C39ZSD3Q/4.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,true,false,false]},
