  "b0c3b13n8z": {"title":"Makimoo Outdoor Chair Cushions Set of 2, Thick Padded High-Back Seat Pads with Ties for Patio Garden Furniture, Weather-Resistant Polyester, 110 x 55 cm (Blue Paisley)","bullets":"Set of 2 for Coordinated Outdoor Style: Includes two matching high-back chair cushions featuring a vibrant blue paisley print, instantly refreshing patio, deck, or garden seating.\n\nGenerous Chair-Friendly Size: Each cushion measures 110 x 55cm, offering ample coverage and support for standard outdoor high-back dining or lounge chairs.\n\nDurable Weather-Resistant Fabric: Crafted from 100% polyester with a water-resistant coating to withstand light rain, sun exposure, and daily outdoor use.\n\nSecure Tie Attachments: Built-in corner ties keep each cushion firmly in place, preventing shifting or slipping while you relax or entertain.\n\nPlush Comfort, Easy Care: Thick padded fill delivers lasting comfort, while the fade-resistant cover wipes clean easily for low-maintenance seasonal enjoyment.","sku":"US-G5OI7J","images":["/images/products/B0C3B13N8Z/1.webp","/images/products/B0C3B13N8Z/2.webp","/images/products/B0C3B13N8Z/3.webp","/images/products/B0C3B13N8Z/4.webp","/images/products/B0C3B13N8Z/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,true,true,true,false]},
