  "1688-828008656438-c3": {"title":"2 Pack Luxury Hotel Style Cotton Bath Mat Set Extra Thick Absorbent Bathroom Floor Towel Non Slip Jacquard Weave Quick Dry Soft Shower Rug For Bathroom Home Spa 50 x 80 cm (White)","bullets":"Premium 100% Cotton Construction: Crafted from pure natural cotton with a thick jacquard weave, these bath mats deliver a soft and comfortable feel underfoot while offering lasting durability for daily use in busy bathrooms.\n\nSuperior Absorbency and Quick Drying: The dense cotton fibers quickly soak up water after showers or baths, helping keep your floors dry and reducing moisture buildup for a fresher bathroom environment.\n\nNon Slip Design for Added Safety: Engineered to stay securely in place on smooth bathroom floors, providing steady footing and extra stability when stepping out of the shower or tub.\n\nGenerous 2-Piece Set with Large Coverage: Each mat measures 50 x 80cm, offering ample floor coverage for doorways, vanity areas, and shower exits while the two-pack allows convenient placement in multiple bathrooms.\n\nEasy Care and Versatile Use: Machine washable for effortless cleaning, these mats maintain their shape and absorbency wash after wash, making them ideal for home bathrooms, guest suites, hotels, and spas.","sku":"US-XFOXWN","images":["/images/products/1688-828008656438-C3/1.webp","/images/products/1688-828008656438-C3/2.webp","/images/products/1688-828008656438-C3/3.webp","/images/products/1688-828008656438-C3/4.webp","/images/products/1688-828008656438-C3/5.webp","/images/products/1688-828008656438-C3/6.webp","/images/products/1688-828008656438-C3/7.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,false,false,false,false,false,true]},
  "1688-828008656438-c2": {"title":"2-Pack Luxury Hotel Style 100% Cotton Bath Mats 50 x 80 cm Large Highly Absorbent Quick-Dry Jacquard Stone Pattern Thick Plush Soft Bathroom Floor Towels Machine Washable (White)","bullets":"Hotel-Quality 100% Cotton: Woven from pure cotton fibers, these bath mats offer a plush, skin-friendly feel that brings resort-style comfort to your daily routine.\n\nHighly Absorbent & Quick-Drying: The thick cotton pile quickly soaks up water after showers or baths, helping feet dry faster while allowing the mat to air dry between uses.\n\nGenerous 50 x 80cm Coverage: Each mat measures 50 x 80cm, providing ample floor protection and a cushioned surface underfoot for bathrooms, guest suites, and spa-inspired spaces.\n\nElegant Jacquard Stone Pattern: The raised stone-flower jacquard design adds subtle texture and a refined hotel look that complements a wide range of bathroom decor styles.\n\nEasy-Care & Long-Lasting: Machine washable for simple upkeep, the durable cotton construction retains its softness and shape through regular use and laundering.","sku":"US-G9NI6W","images":["/images/products/1688-828008656438-C2/1.webp","/images/products/1688-828008656438-C2/2.webp","/images/products/1688-828008656438-C2/3.webp","/images/products/1688-828008656438-C2/4.webp","/images/products/1688-828008656438-C2/5.webp","/images/products/1688-828008656438-C2/6.webp","/images/products/1688-828008656438-C2/7.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false,true,true]},
