  "1688-1046667161713": {"title":"American Vintage Kitchen Rug Non Slip Absorbent Diatomaceous Earth Mat Washable Soft Textured Floor Mat For Kitchen Sink Laundry Hallway And Entryway 50 x 80 cm (Multicolor)","bullets":"Absorbent Diatom Mud Surface: Features a diatom mud-inspired top layer that quickly absorbs water, oil, and everyday kitchen spills, helping keep floors dry and tidy while you cook or wash dishes.\n\nNon Slip Rubber Backing: Built with a durable rubber underside featuring a tire-inspired texture that grips hard floors firmly, reducing movement and adding stability on wet tiles.\n\nSoft Cushioned Support: The resilient, springy surface provides gentle cushioning underfoot and helps protect dropped bowls, plates, and glassware from chips or cracks.\n\nVintage Embossed Pattern: Showcases an American-style raised woven design in rich multicolor tones, adding warmth and decorative character to kitchens, dining rooms, laundry areas, and entryways.\n\nEasy Care And Versatile Size: Measures 50 x 80cm and fits neatly in front of sinks, stoves, and islands; simply shake out debris, vacuum, or wipe clean for daily maintenance.","sku":"US-81JOPE","images":["/images/products/1688-1046667161713/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1046667161713/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1046667161713/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1046667161713/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1046667161713/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1046667161713/6.webp","/images/products/1688-1046667161713/7.webp"],"whiteBg":[true,false,false,false,false,false,false]},
  "1688-1064068114006": {"title":"Oval Bathroom Rug Non Slip Water Absorbent Floor Mat Solid Color Sisal Style Vintage Inspired Textured Machine Washable Bath Mat for Bathroom Entryway 50 x 80 cm (Off White)","bullets":"Vintage Sisal-Inspired Texture: This oval bath mat features a raised woven surface and warm solid tone that brings understated elegance to bathrooms, entryways, and laundry rooms.\n\nHighly Absorbent Surface: The thick, plush fibers help trap water from wet feet after showers or baths, keeping your floors cleaner and drier between uses.\n\nStable Non-Slip Backing: Designed with a skid-resistant underside, the rug stays securely in place on tile, wood, laminate, and other common floor types.\n\nMachine Washable for Easy Care: Simply toss the mat in the washing machine for hassle-free cleaning; durable construction helps it retain its shape and textured look over time.\n\nVersatile Oval Fit: Measuring 50 x 80cm, this compact yet generous size works well in front of sinks, tubs, showers, and doorways.","sku":"US-2Z4GCU","images":["/images/products/1688-1064068114006/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1064068114006/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1064068114006/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1064068114006/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1064068114006/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1064068114006/6.webp","/images/products/1688-1064068114006/7.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false,false,false]},
  "1688-1064068114006-c2": {"title":"Premium Thick Oval Bath Mat Imitation Sisal Woven Bathroom Rug Super Absorbent Non Slip Soft Shower Floor Mat With Quick Dry Backing For Indoor Home Use 50 x 80 cm (Brown)","bullets":"Premium Imitation Sisal Texture: Crafted with a thick woven surface that mimics natural sisal, featuring a raised hazelnut-grain texture that feels soft, springy, and gentle against bare feet.\n\nSuper Absorbent & Quick Dry: The dense woven surface absorbs water quickly after showers and baths, helping keep your bathroom floor dry and reducing the risk of wet, slippery surfaces.\n\nNon-Slip Safety Backing: Equipped with a strong anti-slip bottom layer that grips firmly to tile, wood, and laminate floors, providing stable footing for every step out of the shower.\n\nOval Design in Elegant Solid Brown: The 50 x 80cm oval shape fits neatly beside tubs, vanities, and shower doors, while the warm neutral tone complements modern, rustic, and minimalist bathroom decor.\n\nEasy Care & Long-Lasting Use: Simply shake out, vacuum, or wipe clean to refresh; the durable construction resists shedding and deformation, making it ideal for daily bathroom, entryway, or laundry room use.","sku":"US-E2HCO5","images":["/images/products/1688-1064068114006-C2/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1064068114006-C2/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1064068114006-C2/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1064068114006-C2/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1064068114006-C2/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1064068114006-C2/6.webp","/images/products/1688-1064068114006-C2/7.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false,true,true]},
  "1688-1052755373494": {"title":"Round Outdoor Area Rug Sisal Look Woven Texture Floor Mat for Balcony Patio Deck Living Room Bedroom Durable Scratch Resistant Pet Friendly Home Decor 100 x 100 cm (Camel)","bullets":"Natural Sisal Look Weave: This round rug showcases a dense pineapple loop texture that captures the organic warmth and visual appeal of real sisal without the roughness, creating a relaxed coastal, farmhouse, or boho atmosphere in living rooms, bedrooms, and covered outdoor lounges.\n\nWear and Scratch Resistant Construction: Engineered with tightly packed synthetic fibers that stand up to daily foot traffic, patio furniture movement, and pet claws, helping the surface keep its shape and color through regular use.\n\nVersatile Indoor and Outdoor Placement: Sized at 100 x 100cm, the circular design anchors round seating areas, balcony bistro sets, patio conversation nooks, and reading corners while softening hard floors and concrete surfaces.\n\nNeat Edge Binding That Lays Flat: Finished with reinforced overlock stitching and a low profile design so the rug lies flush against floors, resists bunching, and fits neatly under sofa, chair, and table legs.\n\nEasy Care Neutral Home Decor: Available in camel, beige, and grey to blend with wicker, wood, rattan, and modern furniture; simply shake out debris, vacuum on a low setting, or spot clean with mild soap to refresh the look.","sku":"US-36LPQA","images":["/images/products/1688-1052755373494/1.webp","/images/products/1688-1052755373494/2.webp","/images/products/1688-1052755373494/3.webp","/images/products/1688-1052755373494/4.webp","/images/products/1688-1052755373494/5.webp","/images/products/1688-1052755373494/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,true,false,true]},
