  "1688-595229918569-c3": {"title":"Super Soft Faux Rabbit Fur Area Rug Thick Plush Shaggy Carpet for Living Room Bedroom Nursery Modern Minimalist Home Decor Bedside Floor Mat 160 x 200 cm (Silver Grey)","bullets":"Luxurious Faux Rabbit Fur Comfort: Crafted from high-density faux rabbit fur material, this ultra-soft area rug offers a silky smooth touch and plush cushioning underfoot, creating a cozy retreat for relaxing, reading, or lounging in any room.\n\nGenerous Size for Versatile Placement: Measuring 160 x 200cm, the large rectangular rug fits perfectly under coffee tables, beside beds, in front of sofas, or across bay windows, adding warmth and texture to living rooms, bedrooms, and nurseries.\n\nModern Minimalist Aesthetic: The elegant silver grey tone and clean solid design blend seamlessly with Nordic, contemporary, and minimalist interiors, making it a stylish foundation piece that elevates your home decor.\n\nThick Plush Pile for Everyday Comfort: The dense shaggy surface provides a warm, inviting feel while helping to muffle footsteps, ideal for creating a quiet and comfortable atmosphere in high-traffic family areas.\n\nEasy to Maintain: Simply shake out or vacuum regularly to keep the rug looking fresh and fluffy. The lightweight construction allows for effortless repositioning between rooms as your decor needs change.","sku":"US-ADAKMD","images":["/images/products/1688-595229918569-C3/1.webp","/images/products/1688-595229918569-C3/2.webp","/images/products/1688-595229918569-C3/3.webp","/images/products/1688-595229918569-C3/4.webp","/images/products/1688-595229918569-C3/5.webp","/images/products/1688-595229918569-C3/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false,false]},
  "1688-745181807454-c4": {"title":"Turkish Persian Vintage Area Rug, Bohemian Geometric Medallion Pattern, Soft Low Pile Floor Carpet for Living Room Bedroom Dining Room, Large 160 x 230 cm (Multicolor)","bullets":"Intricate Turkish Persian Medallion Pattern: Features a colorful geometric lattice with diamond medallions in red, blue, yellow, and green on an ivory background, delivering a vintage bohemian look that enlivens living rooms, bedrooms, and dining spaces.\n\nSpacious 160 x 230cm Coverage: Generously sized to anchor sofas, coffee tables, beds, and dining sets, helping define seating or sleeping areas while protecting floors in medium to large rooms.\n\nSoft Low Pile Comfort: The smooth, low profile surface feels gentle underfoot, fits neatly under furniture, and allows doors to pass over it with ease.\n\nVersatile Style for Any Room: The multicolor tribal motif blends with bohemian, farmhouse, eclectic, and traditional décor, working as an area rug, accent carpet, or bedside floor covering.\n\nEasy Everyday Care: Simply vacuum regularly and spot clean spills to maintain the fresh appearance of this durable floor rug.","sku":"US-X5X94H","images":["/images/products/1688-745181807454-C4/1.webp","/images/products/1688-745181807454-C4/2.webp","/images/products/1688-745181807454-C4/3.webp","/images/products/1688-745181807454-C4/4.webp","/images/products/1688-745181807454-C4/5.webp","/images/products/1688-745181807454-C4/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false,false]},
  "1688-745181807454-c6": {"title":"Vintage Medallion Indoor Area Rug for Living Room Bedroom Dining Room Turkish Persian Oriental Soft Low Pile Non Slip Foldable Home Decor Carpet 160 x 230 cm (Multicolor)","bullets":"Elegant Vintage Medallion Design: Inspired by classic Turkish and Persian motifs, this 160 x 230cm area rug showcases an intricate central medallion, ornate borders, and a rich multicolor palette of navy, amber, coral, and cream. The traditional yet timeless pattern adds warmth and character to living rooms, bedrooms, dining areas, and home offices.\n\nSoft Low-Profile Pile: Crafted with a short 0.4cm pile height, the rug feels smooth underfoot while remaining low enough to fit under furniture and doorways. The compact surface helps reduce dust buildup and makes everyday cleaning quick and convenient.\n\nVersatile Placement for Any Room: Sized at 160 x 230cm, this rectangular carpet works beautifully under coffee tables, sofas, beds, and dining sets. Use it as a statement piece in the living room, a cozy accent beside the bed, or a decorative layer in entryways and reading nooks.\n\nNon Slip Foldable Construction: The lightweight, foldable design allows the rug to lay flat quickly after unpacking and adapt easily to different spaces. A non slip backing helps keep the rug securely in place on hardwood, tile, laminate, and other common floor types.\n\nEasy to Maintain: Regular vacuuming and gentle spot cleaning keep colors looking vibrant and details crisp. The durable construction stands up to daily foot traffic, making it a practical choice for busy households with children or pets.","sku":"US-D5GOK2","images":["/images/products/1688-745181807454-C6/1.webp","/images/products/1688-745181807454-C6/2.webp","/images/products/1688-745181807454-C6/3.webp","/images/products/1688-745181807454-C6/4.webp","/images/products/1688-745181807454-C6/5.webp","/images/products/1688-745181807454-C6/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false,false]},
