  "1688-745181807454-c8": {"title":"Elegant Turkish Persian Area Rug Vintage Oriental Medallion Pattern Non Slip Low Pile Floor Carpet for Living Room Bedroom Sofa Coffee Table Home Decor 160 x 230 cm (Black Gold)","bullets":"Intricate Oriental Medallion Design: Showcases a richly detailed Turkish Persian inspired pattern with elaborate floral scrollwork and a striking central medallion, adding timeless vintage elegance and exotic character to living rooms, bedrooms, and dining spaces.\n\nGenerous Coverage for Multiple Rooms: At 160 x 230cm, this rectangular area rug provides ample surface coverage beneath sofas, coffee tables, beds, and dining sets, making it a versatile foundation for both high-traffic living areas and cozy private retreats.\n\nLow Pile Profile for Daily Convenience: The approximately 0.4cm slim construction allows doors to glide smoothly over the surface while offering a comfortable underfoot feel and easy placement under furniture.\n\nStable Non Slip Backing: Features a practical anti-skid underside designed to help keep the rug securely positioned on hardwood, tile, and laminate floors, reducing unwanted movement during everyday activities.\n\nDurable Quality for Long-Lasting Beauty: Made with carefully selected fibers and reinforced edges, this decorative floor carpet withstands regular foot traffic while maintaining its rich color scheme and detailed ornamental pattern over time.","sku":"US-BO1SUD","images":["/images/products/1688-745181807454-C8/1.webp","/images/products/1688-745181807454-C8/2.webp","/images/products/1688-745181807454-C8/3.webp","/images/products/1688-745181807454-C8/4.webp","/images/products/1688-745181807454-C8/5.webp","/images/products/1688-745181807454-C8/6.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,true,false,false,false]},
