  "bedset4-lilac-queen": {"title":"Makimoo 4 Piece Bedding Set Queen Duvet Cover 88 x 88 in Fitted Sheet 60 x 80 in 2 Pillowcases 20 x 30 in Soft Microfiber Botanical Floral Print (Purple Grey)","bullets":"COMPLETE 4 PIECE BEDDING SET: This coordinated set arrives with 1 duvet cover 88 x 88 in, 1 fitted sheet 60 x 80 in, and 2 pillowcases 20 x 30 in, so one order covers the whole bed. Every piece shares the same small floral print, creating a tidy, matched look from the pillows down to the foot of the bed.\n\nSOFT BRUSHED MICROFIBER SURFACE: The bedding is made from finely brushed microfiber that feels smooth and gentle against the skin. Lightweight yet cozy, the fabric drapes neatly over the mattress and pillow without a stiff, heavy feel, making it a comfortable choice for everyday sleeping.\n\nFITTED SHEET WITH ALL AROUND ELASTIC: The 60 x 80 in fitted sheet has an all around elastic edge that pulls the fabric snugly under the mattress and helps hold it in place through the night. It is sized for Queen beds and keeps a clean, smooth look with fewer wrinkles.\n\nDUVET COVER AND MATCHING PILLOWCASES: The 88 x 88 in duvet cover layers easily over your comforter to keep it fresh and protected, while the two 20 x 30 in pillowcases complete the styling at the head of the bed. The patterned panels and matching cases keep the whole arrangement visually consistent.\n\nEASY CARE AND CALM FLORAL STYLE: The muted purple grey base with scattered small blossoms blends with wood furniture, neutral walls, and layered throws. For care, machine wash cold with like colors and tumble dry low to keep the fabric soft and the print looking its best season after season.","sku":"US-Y1Z9C1","images":["/images/products/BEDSET4-LILAC-QUEEN/1.webp","/images/products/BEDSET4-LILAC-QUEEN/2.webp","/images/products/BEDSET4-LILAC-QUEEN/3.webp","/images/products/BEDSET4-LILAC-QUEEN/4.webp","/images/products/BEDSET4-LILAC-QUEEN/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false]},
