  "bedset4-mauve-queen": {"title":"Makimoo 4 Piece Shabby Chic Bedding Set with Duvet Cover Fitted Sheet and 2 Pillowcases Lace Trim Floral Print Soft Microfiber for Queen Size Bed 88 x 88 in (Purple Pink)","bullets":"FOUR PIECE BEDDING SET: Each set arrives with one duvet cover measuring 88 x 88 in, one fitted sheet measuring 60 x 80 in, and two pillowcases measuring 20 x 30 in each. All four pieces are cut from the same fabric run, so the floral print and lace trim line up neatly across the bed, and you get a coordinated look without hunting for matching pillow shams or a spare sheet separately.\n\nROMANTIC LACE TRIM AND FLORAL PRINT: Scalloped lace edging traces the outer border of the duvet cover and both pillowcases, framing a delicate all over pattern of small scattered blossoms. The contrast between the creamy lace line and the printed ground gives the bed a soft, vintage inspired look that suits cottage, farmhouse, and French country style bedrooms.\n\nSOFT DUSTY PURPLE PINK TONE: The muted purple pink ground keeps the print gentle rather than loud, so it layers easily with white, cream, grey, or natural wood furniture. The tone reads warm in daylight and calm under lamps, making it a restful choice for a main bedroom, a guest room, or a teen room that needs a softer color story.\n\nSMOOTH FABRIC WITH A RELAXED DRAPE: The woven fabric feels smooth against the skin and falls in soft folds over the mattress instead of standing stiff at the corners. It is light enough for warm nights and substantial enough to layer a quilt or blanket on top when the weather turns cool, giving you one set that works across seasons.\n\nEASY CARE AND GIFT READY: The set can be machine washed on a gentle cycle and laid flat or tumble dried low, so refreshing the bed between washes takes little effort. Folded neatly, it also makes a practical housewarming, wedding, or new apartment gift for anyone setting up a bedroom from scratch.","sku":"US-F6E4B7","images":["/images/products/BEDSET4-MAUVE-QUEEN/1.webp","/images/products/BEDSET4-MAUVE-QUEEN/2.webp","/images/products/BEDSET4-MAUVE-QUEEN/3.webp","/images/products/BEDSET4-MAUVE-QUEEN/4.webp","/images/products/BEDSET4-MAUVE-QUEEN/5.webp"],"whiteBg":[false,false,false,false,false]},
